msgid "nat.hello"
msgstr "Hi, Tommy! Every egg holds a different dino. Look after them well and they'll grow up strong and happy."

msgid "juan.hello"
msgstr "Morning, champ! What will it be today? I've got fresh seeds."

msgid "juampi.about"
msgstr "“%s”? Let me help!"

msgid "tip.pet"
msgstr "Walk up to any dino with an empty hand and press A. They love cuddles!"

msgid "tip.feed"
msgstr "Grab some food (ferns, berries, kibble...) and press A in front of a dino. Check what each one eats."

msgid "tip.scoop"
msgstr "Carry the shovel in a slot and press A on the poop. It keeps the dinos clean!"

msgid "tip.brush"
msgstr "With the brush in hand, press A in front of a dino. Sparkles!"

msgid "tip.harvest"
msgstr "Berry bushes and ferns give a harvest every day. Press A in front of them."

msgid "tip.plant"
msgstr "Buy seeds from Grandpa Juan and press A on the garden bed. Then water it every day."

msgid "tip.fill"
msgstr "With food in hand, press A on the trough. The dinos go eat by themselves."

msgid "tip.play"
msgstr "With the ball in hand, press A near a dino to play. Or throw it far!"

msgid "tip.feed_dino"
msgstr "Find that dino and hand-feed it. Its favourite food gives extra hearts!"

msgid "tip.pet_dino"
msgstr "Find that dino and pet it with an empty hand (B switches slots)."

msgid "tip.general_1"
msgstr "B switches slots. Hold it to drop what you're carrying."

msgid "tip.general_2"
msgstr "If a dino shows a little bubble, it's telling you what it needs."

msgid "tip.general_3"
msgstr "With coins you can buy new land: each habitat brings different dinos."

msgid "tip.general_4"
msgstr "Eggs go in the incubator and hatch the next morning. Give it a nice name!"

msgid "tip.general_5"
msgstr "Happy dinos grow: from baby to youngster to grown-up."

msgid "tip.general_6"
msgstr "When kids visit, see if they want something. They leave coins!"

msgid "tip.general_7"
msgstr "Things you buy come in a box: press A where you want to put it."

msgid "kid.want"
msgstr "Hi! Could you get me some %s? Please!"

msgid "kid.happy"
msgstr "Your dinos are so cute! I love this farm!"

msgid "kid.thanks"
msgstr "Thanks! They gave you %d coins"

msgid "toast.visitor"
msgstr "A visitor came to the farm!"

msgid "toast.visitor_tip"
msgstr "The visitor left %d coins in the piggy bank"

msgid "fact.trike"
msgstr "It had three horns and a huge frill. Its skull was one of the biggest of any land animal ever!"

msgid "fact.stego"
msgstr "The plates on its back may have flushed with colour to show off. Its brain was the size of a walnut!"

msgid "fact.ankylo"
msgstr "It was like an armoured tank, with a bony club at the end of its tail."

msgid "fact.brachio"
msgstr "It was as tall as a four-storey building and ate leaves from the treetops."

msgid "fact.parasaur"
msgstr "Its crest was hollow: it used it like a trumpet to call its friends."

msgid "fact.pachy"
msgstr "Its head had a bony dome 25 cm thick."

msgid "fact.iguanodon"
msgstr "It had a spiky thumb. It was one of the first dinosaurs ever discovered!"

msgid "fact.proto"
msgstr "It was small like a sheep and laid its eggs in sandy nests."

msgid "fact.galli"
msgstr "It ran very fast, like an ostrich — maybe 60 km an hour!"

msgid "fact.therizino"
msgstr "It had giant claws, almost a metre long! But it ate plants."

msgid "fact.trex"
msgstr "It had tiny but very strong arms, and an amazing sense of smell."

msgid "fact.raptor"
msgstr "Real velociraptors were the size of a turkey and had feathers."

msgid "fact.spino"
msgstr "It was one of the biggest dinosaurs and loved swimming and fishing."

msgid "fact.dilo"
msgstr "It had two thin crests on its head, like a hairdo."

msgid "fact.carno"
msgstr "It had little horns like a bull and teeny-tiny arms."

msgid "fact.compy"
msgstr "It was the size of a chicken — one of the smallest dinosaurs!"

msgid "fact.microraptor"
msgstr "It had feathers on all four limbs and glided from tree to tree."

msgid "fact.ptera"
msgstr "It wasn't a dinosaur but a flying reptile, a dino cousin. Its wings were as wide as a car!"

msgid "fact.archaeo"
msgstr "It was half dinosaur, half bird: feathers, wings and teeth."

msgid "fact.plesio"
msgstr "It lived in the sea and swam with four flippers, like a giant long-necked turtle."

